### ==============================================================================
### DroolsStatelessController: Order Discount & Loyalty Points
### Demonstrates: StatelessKieSession, Salience, Activation Groups
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Platinum Tier VIP Customer (25% Discount + Free Shipping + 2x Points)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateless/discount
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1001",
  "orderAmount": 250.0,
  "customer": {
    "id": "CUST-001",
    "name": "Alice Cooper",
    "loyaltyTier": "PLATINUM",
    "loyaltyPoints": 420
  }
}

###

### 2. Gold Tier Customer (15% Discount + Free Shipping)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateless/discount
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1002",
