### 4. Regular Customer Bulk Purchase (5% Discount for >= $150)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateless/discount
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1004",
  "orderAmount": 160.0,
  "customer": {
    "id": "CUST-004",
    "name": "David Bowie",
    "loyaltyTier": "REGULAR",
    "loyaltyPoints": 10
  }
}

###

### 5. Regular Customer Under Threshold (Fallback Base Loyalty Points Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drools/stateless/discount
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-1005",
  "orderAmount": 45.0,
  "customer": {
    "id": "CUST-005",
    "name": "Emma Watson",
    "loyaltyTier": "REGULAR",
    "loyaltyPoints": 5
  }
}
